WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.980
Now there are <i>three</i> of them.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.360
Qiongqi, Hundun, and Taotie...

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.360
For Hishigata, who isn't even a necromancer,
to keep using them is extremely dangerous.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.480
I have to make sure that Hishigata
and Hirumi are stopped.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:26.830
Everything that's happened has
happened because I came to this city.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:49.520
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.470
"#09 Memory of Death (10031 Deaths)"

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:08.810
Huotou,

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.650
we're the only ones
who can stop Hirumi. Let's go!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.650
Acknowledged, Adonai.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.700
We're about to obtain the formula.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.840
Using it, my Hirumi will achieve
a domain no one else ever has.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.290
Our dream will come true at last.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.860
That's right, Hirumi!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:31.460
Brother, what will you do after that?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.090
After that?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:38.380
Academy City will be forced
to acknowledge our success.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:42.260
No! I was asking about
stuff outside of research!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.510
Oh, that? Sorry. Well, let's see...

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.100
When morning comes,
I'll get up, and at night, I'll go to sleep.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.230
I'll make sure we eat our meals at home.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.940
From now on, you and I are going
to live normal, happy lives.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.380
What is it that <i>you</i> want to do?

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:58.900
I...

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.990
I just want you to be there with me, Brother.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.370
This guy doesn't give up.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.880
Heap of junk #1,

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.720
you're getting tuckered out, aren't you?!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.320
You never learn,
you just send replacements, huh?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.660
Hey in there, what's the matter?!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.200
Whew, that was close.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.960
Brother, look.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.460
The line's been disconnected?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.210
Damn.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.340
That last little mishap messed things up?!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.380
Ah, this is driving me crazy!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:07.640
We're so close!
We're so close to getting the formula!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.130
Brother, calm down.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.350
You're right, Hirumi.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.310
We'll just have to recover Hundun

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:18.400
and transfer the rest of
the formula data hard-wired.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.150
Hirumi?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.320
I just had a great idea.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:26.450
"Experiencing signal interference.
Due to system interference, School District 16
is now off-limits. Please evacuate at once."

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:31.290
Due to system interference with
the infrastructure in School District 16,

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.580
Academy City has designated it off-limits.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:37.420
All those currently in said district,
please evacuate at once. Repeat...

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.800
Keep back! The area ahead is off-limits!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.710
For real?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.550
We can't go to school?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.220
Does that mean we have it off?

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.190
--What was that?
--A person?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:07.240
Target Accelerator acquired.
Predicted trajectory calculated.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.620
Disregarding mission damage
to surrounding area.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.580
Transmitting data to Taotie.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.620
Receiving data from Qiongqi.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.930
How's my different way of thinking, Brother?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:31.930
Slow him down, rather than fighting him?
Nice idea, Hirumi.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.690
Tch.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.440
It's tacky to imitate others!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.370
Heap of junk #3, you dropped this!!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:01.340
That twisted freak got away.
After making this big a scene fleeing,

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.670
I can pretty well tell 
which direction you went.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.390
Tell him something for me--

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.890
that I'm on my way, right now!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:35.950
Mm-hmm, it really is faster
to download over cables!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.420
95%... 97...

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.170
99...

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.720
A-Accelerator!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.390
Huh?

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:33.890
"I-It was you..." says Misaka,
recognizing the person who saved her,

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.310
as faint surprise surfaces.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:43.520
"Welcome back!" Misaka Misaka senses
your presence and springs awake!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.820
Huh? He's not here. It was a dream?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:58.700
"Ugh, I'm so bored," mutters Misaka Misaka.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.210
Huh?

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:07.130
Mm-hmm, true to your title as first-ranked.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.090
That voice--

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.140
from the moment I first heard it,
I found it unpleasant,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.600
and now, so is your face.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.100
I hate this guy.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.310
Now, now, don't be hasty, and hear me out.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.270
We've just gotten to the best part!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.560
Do you happen to know the extent of
my research over these last few years?

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:30.900
The espers aboard Qiongqi and Taotie,
which were easily beaten by you,

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.990
were originally Level 3.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.320
But with my esper boosting
and Esther's pseudo-souls,

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:40.370
their abilities were raised up to Level 5!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.250
Ah, but they were still no match for you.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.370
Are you a complete idiot?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.710
If you hook junk up to more junk,
you're going to get junk.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.010
Yeah, you're right, mm-hmm.
Up to now, anyway.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.640
Up to now? After everything that's happened,

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:00.310
do you still think you can gain even
a millimeter of victory against me?

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.810
Mm-hmm, well,

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:05.600
I have the memories of
10,031 deaths that I got from her.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.730
Once I install my formula into those three,

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.860
you'll have opponents that 
are more satisfying--

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.030
or rather, that you can grovel before.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.860
They'll be tough foes
you can call friends, mm-hmm.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.240
Okay, time to push the button.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.910
Not necessary. I don't need any more trouble.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.870
Beat it with your good-for-nothing darkness.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:29.170
Hirumi... Me and Hirumi's dream...!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:35.050
Did your brain just snap from despair?!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:42.680
Just kidding. It's already been installed.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:46.520
It's already... been installed!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:53.820
Oh, when you arrived
I was inwardly pretty anxious.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.860
You really are a genius, Brother!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.860
Mm-hmm, it's just about time to restart them.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.840
We'll leave him to you.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.500
Let's get going, Brother.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.960
Mm-hmm, to one last fine tuning.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:16.920
Huh?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:20.840
The formula was originally meant
for Hirumi. Once I install it,

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:25.390
she will become the absolute esper,
a Level 6. Mm-hmm.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.140
That means she'll surpass you!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.400
Just go right on dreaming.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.320
Out of my way, you heap of junk.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.780
Huh...?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.580
Get on out of here, now.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.380
But...

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.790
Scram!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.590
Misaka wanted to fight with you,

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:01.260
but is worried about being a bother
and giving you some distance.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:07.520
You don't have to be considerate.
Don't forget what I did to all of you.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.230
Just keep quiet and hold it against me.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:15.940
Now then, that problematic bit
of baggage has been recovered,

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.530
so now I can take you apart!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.870
He vanished--no, he was removed!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.670
Asportation?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.360
I'll bet that was pretty surprising, huh?

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.490
Mm-hmm, he disappeared
right before your eyes.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.990
It's a new ability that Taotie
has acquired, thanks to my formula.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.120
Of course, the formula also allows
the evolved Taotie and Qiongqi

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.870
to link with each other's vision.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.210
Whatever Qiongqi's camera captures...

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.830
Target acquired.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.840
...is shared with Taotie, 
in a remote location,

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.420
allowing him to be projected there.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.760
Thus concludes my spoiler reveal.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.180
There's really no way
to convey it, though. Mm-mm.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.100
And that's not all, either.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.390
Qiongqi identified.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:39.320
By sharing vision with Taotie,
something like <i>this</i> becomes possible.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.240
So take the ability-boosting
power of my coffins,

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.650
add the Si-xiong talismans 
I stole from Esther,

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.780
and top it off with the formula
I just finished installing.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:50.870
By fusing the three together,
Qiongqi and Taotie are now invincible!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.330
Mm-hmm, the first-ranked is going to die.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:58.250
The ability of the body inside Taotie

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.630
was just a humble matter 
transportation ability,

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.430
allowing her to trade places
with her favorite stuffed animal.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:09.560
And now, look at the kind of power
it has become! Hey, are you listening?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.650
Mm-hmm, everything is now ready.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.150
When you awaken, you'll be a Level 6.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:24.950
Brother, thanks so much for
everything you've done for me up to now.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:28.740
It wasn't just for you, Hirumi.
It was for both of us, right?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.910
Mm-hmm, that's true.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:36.250
Once this is over,
the two of us should go to your gym.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.210
I'll tag along with you.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.090
Hirumi? Don't you want to go to the gym?

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:49.970
Mm-mm, let's both go!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.140
Okay, I'm starting it.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.390
Mm-hmm.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.200
Hey heap of junk chief,

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.790
I'm gonna destroy the two rust buckets
in front of me in a flash,

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.580
and then head to you.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:21.000
Go ahead and let your life flash before
your eyes while you shake like a leaf.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.590
I can't have you coming back here,
nor are you able to yet.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.510
The second round is just beginning.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.220
Huh? Who do you think you're talking to?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.220
Okay, let's begin.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.360
Surprised? Mm-hmm, that's 
the formula at work.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.360
A boosted version of Replace?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.400
Mm-hmm, correct.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:59.000
"This is how Taotie and Qiongqi
have been enhanced

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.130
using the memories of 10,031 deaths..."

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.470
...says Misaka, who recognizes 
what is happening,

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.930
but without a weapon with which
to assist, must grit her teeth in dismay.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.660
You're all right?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.540
Master!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.710
"Master?" says Misaka,
asking what you mean by that.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.250
Accelerator is my master!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.500
Where is Hishigata, the one who captured you?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.420
I have to defeat them, and help Master!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.640
Still another 20% to go? Huh?

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.480
Damn. Who is it?!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.650
Hundun...

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:21.580
Danger to Adonai detected.
Commencing threat elimination action.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:25.500
Esther, you dare come back here now?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:29.340
Hishigata, I'm here
to keep my promise to Hirumi!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:33.680
What you see is Taowu, one of the
Evil Spirits of the Numbers in Hirumi's skin!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:39.310
Mm-hmm, never mind about all that.
I'll show you my results soon enough.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.310
Hundun, if you would?

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.070
Not even a scratch, third-string!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.660
That's what they were up to?

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.020
I need to smash that big lunk
that keeps popping things in and out.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.790
Not yet! Not yet!

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.970
Now it's time to bust you open!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.050
"He is...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.640
...taking the friction of 
all the sand colliding,

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.390
and releasing the heat from it
all at once to ignite the debris.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:11.690
It is like a whirlwind of fire,"
says Misaka, mumbling to herself.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.860
"The objective is Taotie's sight.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:17.820
By destroying the camera,
he can shut down their enhanced Replace,"

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:21.120
says Misaka, again mumbling to herself.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:33.550
Now that your camera is destroyed,
you can't see a thing.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:43.810
Now, how should I finish 
off this remaining one?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.700
That was terrific!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:59.860
This many of them should be plenty!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.030
Heap of junk shish kabobs!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.230
You don't know when to give up.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:40.280
Still, it's cool that you never
gave up struggling to the very end.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.470
I'd expect no less from the first-ranked.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.100
Taking out Taotie and Qiongqi,
even with the formula installed,

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:10.480
was a piece of cake for you.
Do you know what "a piece of cake" means?

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:15.110
It means to defeat an enemy easily.
But I am not disappointed by this.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.780
Those two bought the time I wanted--

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:23.860
the time I needed to make
my Hirumi perfect, you see.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.160
Tch.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:32.710
Ah, but you're too late.
The countdown has already begun.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.080
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:40.260
No matter what shortcut you take
with your powers, you won't make it in time!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.560
Not bad at all.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.400
But you won't make it in time, either.

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:02.700
As head of the Rosenthal family,
I can't let him do this anymore.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.530
Using Emperor Shun's Blade,

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.490
if I can stab Taowu,
who is possessing Hirumi's body,

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.870
I'll be able to separate
the pseudo-soul from her.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.920
That is not Hirumi.
Hirumi is no longer in our world.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.390
98...

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.490
--Hirumi!
--99...

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:29.100
Stop!

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:43.440
Y-You murderer...!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:56.580
It's finished... Too bad for you, Esther...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:22:00.590
This is Level 6... mm-hmm...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.010
"Next time"

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Catastrophe"
